; An elided posting whose group already nets to zero in every commodity
; absorbs a zero in each of them, sorted by symbol.
2024-01-01 Opening balances
    Assets:Checking     $10
    Assets:Checking     $-10
    Assets:Savings      5 EUR
    Assets:Savings      -5 EUR
    Equity:Opening

; One commodity leaves one zero, at the digits the entry wrote.
2024-01-02 Opening balances
    Assets:Checking     $10.00
    Assets:Checking     $-10.00
    Equity:Opening

; A written zero is a commodity the group wrote.
2024-01-03 Opening balances
    Assets:Checking     $10
    Assets:Checking     $-10
    Assets:Savings      0 EUR
    Equity:Opening

; A priced posting weighs what it cost, so only dollars are left at zero.
2024-01-04 Opening balances
    Assets:Brokerage    10 AAPL @ $5
    Assets:Checking     $-50
    Equity:Opening

